WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.077
Patient metrics provides another unpivot example.

00:00:03.077 --> 00:00:07.287
Heart rate, systolic blood pressure, diastolic blood pressure,

00:00:07.287 --> 00:00:10.622
and oxygen saturation are separate wide columns.

00:00:10.622 --> 00:00:15.102
The lateral VALUES block converts them into metric and value rows.

00:00:15.102 --> 00:00:20.847
This can be useful for generic plotting, rule processing, or feature inspection.

00:00:20.847 --> 00:00:27.727
A pivot converts category values into columns, usually through conditional aggregation in portable SQL.

00:00:27.727 --> 00:00:31.077
Each target column needs a clear aggregation rule.

00:00:31.077 --> 00:00:36.452
Before pivoting, check whether the source contains more than one value for the same row-key and category

00:00:36.452 --> 00:00:37.833
combination.
